         <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_bd32dfc5">
            <titleStmt xml:id="titleStmt_N20318">
               <title xml:id="title_1668679f">Score, manuscript copy, fair copy</title>
               <respStmt xml:id="respStmt_N2031C">
                  <persName role="" xml:id="persName_6f18b2ae">Axel Liebmann, copyist</persName>
               </respStmt>
            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_N20322">
               <extent xml:id="extent_N20323">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N20326">27.5 x 38</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N20329">Written in black ink. Paper: 10 staves. Above the music: "Aandelige Sange af I.P.E. Hartmann". No. I = No. 10 "O, lad din Aand nu med os være; No. II = No.1 "Hører du Røsten" (without text); No. III = No. 6 "O, du Guds Lam". At the end of the music: "Comp. i Sommeren 1870." Beneath the music Liebmann has written: "(Opskreven efter Hukommelsen og derfor maaske paa sine Steder mindre correct)" (Written after the memory; therefore parts of it may be less than correct). In fact there are only a few slips of the mind, mainly in the accompaniment.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
